  2239	    /// Whether this ingress is an `initialize` request — the flag that decides
  2240	    /// session minting.
  2241	    ///
  2242	    /// `server/discover`, `subscriptions/listen` and `tasks/update` are non-init
  2243	    /// by construction (a stateless capability projection, a v2 stream opener and
  2244	    /// a v2 task-input delivery respectively).
  2245	    ///
  2246	    /// Both POST preambles derived this with the same inline `match` before plan
